00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.718
Iyi videwo yerekana uburyo bwo gusuzuma neurovision no gutanga ibirahure.

2
00:00:04.718 --> 00:00:08.020
Karaba intoki zawe kandi ntugashishoze.

3
00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:12.737
Uzakenera imbonerahamwe ya neurovision, ikaramu hamwe nubuvuzi, intera

4
