9
00:00:37.740 --> 00:00:42.500
Andika umurongo muto bashobora gusoma neza.

10
00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:49.220
Niba badashobora gusoma umurongo wa N8, gerageza wongeyeho ibirahuri bya diopter 1.5.

11
00:00:49.220 --> 00:00:53.376
Niba bagishoboye gusoma N8, koresha imbaraga zikurikira, hanyuma

12
00:00:53.376 --> 00:00:54.860
kuri, kugeza igihe zishobora kuba nziza

13
00:00:54.860 --> 00:00:57.540
